{"id":"883e6d2e6b682185","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-kolyvagin.md","title":"Kolyvagin Rank-Bound Property","display":"df-kolyvagin — Kolyvagin Rank-Bound Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kolyvagin","aliases":["58-df-kolyvagin"],"display":"df-kolyvagin — Kolyvagin Rank-Bound Property","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kolyvagin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kolyvagin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kolyvagin — Kolyvagin Rank-Bound Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md\">../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-kolyvagin-—-Kolyvagin-Rank-Bound\">df-kolyvagin — Kolyvagin Rank Bound</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,k,O,K_E,L_E\\in V\\land\\rho,m\\in\\omega\">\\(E,k,O,K_E,L_E\\in V\\land\\rho,m\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (elliptic-curve predicate with field, marked point, and canonical bundle, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md\">../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_E:\\mathbb C\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb C\">\\(L_E:\\mathbb C\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb C\\)</span> (explicit Hasse--Weil <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-function candidate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KolyvaginRankBoundData}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{KolyvaginRankBoundData}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (rank-bound property with explicit analytic and algebraic data, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kolyvagin} \\vdash \\mathrm{KolyvaginRankBoundData}_S(E,k,O,K_E,L_E,\\rho,m) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\\land\\rho=\\dim_{\\mathbb Q}\\bigl(E(k)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}\\mathbb Q\\bigr)\\land\\exists j\\in\\omega\\;(L_E^{(j)}(1)\\neq0)\\land m=\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:L_E^{(j)}(1)\\neq0\\}\\land\\rho\\leq m\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kolyvagin} \\vdash \\mathrm{KolyvaginRankBoundData}_S(E,k,O,K_E,L_E,\\rho,m) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\\land\\rho=\\dim_{\\mathbb Q}\\bigl(E(k)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}\\mathbb Q\\bigr)\\land\\exists j\\in\\omega\\;(L_E^{(j)}(1)\\neq0)\\land m=\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:L_E^{(j)}(1)\\neq0\\}\\land\\rho\\leq m\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The curve parameters, its <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-function, Mordell--Weil rank value, and vanishing-order value are explicit.  No set function with the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as domain is postulated.</li>\n<li>Kolyvagin's Euler-system theorems establish strong rank and Shafarevich-Tate finiteness conclusions under specific Heegner-point hypotheses.</li>\n<li>This atom names the displayed rank-bound property; it does not assert those hypotheses or the bound unconditionally.</li>\n<li>BSD conjecture: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rank} = \\mathrm{ord}_{s=1} L(E, s)\">\\(\\mathrm{rank} = \\mathrm{ord}_{s=1} L(E, s)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-descent: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(K) \\otimes \\mathbb{Z}_p\">\\(E(K) \\otimes \\mathbb{Z}_p\\)</span> relates to Selmer groups.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-kolyvagin-—-Kolyvagin-Rank-Bound","text":"df-kolyvagin — Kolyvagin Rank Bound","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (elliptic-curve predicate with field, marked point, and canonical bundle, see [[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,k,O,K_E,L_E\\in V\\land\\rho,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"L_E:\\mathbb C\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KolyvaginRankBoundData}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kolyvagin} \\vdash \\mathrm{KolyvaginRankBoundData}_S(E,k,O,K_E,L_E,\\rho,m) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\\land\\rho=\\dim_{\\mathbb Q}\\bigl(E(k)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}\\mathbb Q\\bigr)\\land\\exists j\\in\\omega\\;(L_E^{(j)}(1)\\neq0)\\land m=\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:L_E^{(j)}(1)\\neq0\\}\\land\\rho\\leq m","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rank} = \\mathrm{ord}_{s=1} L(E, s)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"E(K) \\otimes \\mathbb{Z}_p","display":false}],"bytes":1655,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-743","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-kolyvagin.md|58-df-kolyvagin]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["74f4744df7db749f"]}